# Who reviews what (docs/TEAM.md). With "Require review from Code Owners" on
# in the branch protection for main, a pull request that touches a path needs
# an approval from one of its owners before it can merge; the owner of the
# repository can always merge. People are named by the address on their
# GitHub account, so this file needs no usernames; the first time someone's
# address is not on their GitHub account, add it there (Settings → Emails).
